<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="w1map" name="Week 1 System Map"><mxGraphModel dx="1720" dy="880" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1754" pageHeight="1240" landscape="1" background="#ffffff" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:26px&quot;&gt;Claude.ai — Conceptual AI System Map&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="18" width="1640" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#444&quot;&gt;Group 3 &amp;#183; SAIA3113 Topic 1 Lab &amp;#183; Built from observed behaviour in Step A1 plus clearly marked engineering assumptions&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="58" width="1640" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ui" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;1. Chat Interface&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.45&quot;&gt;&amp;#8226; User types a message&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Model selector shows&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&quot;Sonnet 5.5&quot;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Disclaimer: Claude can&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;make mistakes&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Action icons: copy,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;thumbs up/down, retry&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Displays connector cards&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;and model-switch notices&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#555;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Evidence: Fig A1.1 to A1.9&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="240" height="430" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="safe" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;2. Input Safeguards&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.45&quot;&gt;&amp;#8226; Checks each message&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;before it is answered&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Flagged Q5 as [cyber]&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;* How risk is detected&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#555;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Evidence: Fig A1.9&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="140" width="240" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="router" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;3. Model Router / Fallback&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.45&quot;&gt;&amp;#8226; Flagged message answered&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;by Sonnet 5 instead&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Offers &quot;Edit and retry&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;with Sonnet 5.5&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;* Routing rules&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#555;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Evidence: Fig A1.9&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="140" width="240" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="model" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;4. Foundation Model (LLM)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.45&quot;&gt;&amp;#8226; Sonnet 5.5 (default)&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Sonnet 5 (fallback)&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Decides when to search&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;or call a connector&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;* System prompt + chat history&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;as context&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#555;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Evidence: Fig A1.1 to A1.9&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="140" width="270" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="train" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;5. Training Data&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#b85450&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Assumed Component]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.45&quot;&gt;&amp;#8226; Large text corpus learned&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;before release&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Cutoff ~end June 2026&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(self-reported)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#555;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Evidence: Fig A1.3&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1430" y="100" width="250" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tools" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;6. External Tools&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.45&quot;&gt;&amp;#8226; Connector search: travel&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;apps listed (observed)&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Web search for recent&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;events (self-described)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#555;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Evidence: Fig A1.3, A1.7&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1430" y="280" width="250" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="filter" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;7. Output Safety Filter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#b85450&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[Assumed Component]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.45&quot;&gt;&amp;#8226; Checks the draft before&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;it is shown&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Refusal + 5 legitimate&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;alternatives in Q5&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#555;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Evidence: Fig A1.9&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="420" width="240" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="fb" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;8. Feedback &amp;amp; Monitoring&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.45&quot;&gt;&amp;#8226; Thumbs up / down on every reply&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; &quot;Send feedback&quot; link on flagged reply&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;* Logging, quality and safety&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;monitoring&l